/P 33 0 R
/E ( Begin with a single product, adopt a focused technological intervention and refine one value-added offering to excellence. From there, scale progressively. Anchored in strong community building, this approach fosters collaboration, resilience and collective growth.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [15]
